This product is a Cangjie (仓颉) port of the EU Digital Identity Wallet
SD-JWT library for Swift:

    eudi-lib-sdjwt-swift
    Copyright (c) European Commission
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
    https://github.com/eu-digital-identity-wallet/eudi-lib-sdjwt-swift

The protocol logic (SD-JWT issuance, selective disclosure, verification,
key binding) is reimplemented in Cangjie with the original Swift sources
used as the reference implementation.

This product depends on and/or bundles the following third-party software:

  - eudi_lib_core_crypto (Apache License 2.0 expected; consumed as a pinned
    third_party clone, not vendored) — real ECDSA P-256 / digest / JWS
    primitives backed by Cangjie stdx.crypto.

  - cangjie-stdx 1.1.3.1 (Apache License 2.0) — Cangjie extended standard
    library runtime, bundled under entry/libs/stdx/. See the LICENSE file
    shipped inside the upstream cangjie-stdx release archive.

  - OpenSSL runtime libraries (libcrypto_openssl.z.so, libssl_openssl.z.so,
    Apache License 2.0) and libsecurec.so, bundled under
    entry/libs/arm64-v8a/ for on-device execution of stdx.crypto.

